# ⚔️ AETHERIA — EQUIPMENT DATABASE

## 1. OVERVIEW

Equipment System menyimpan seluruh equipment yang dapat digunakan oleh Hero.

Equipment dibagi menjadi tiga kategori:

```text
WEAPON
ARMOR
ACCESSORY
```

Equipment memiliki 7 tingkat kualitas:

```text
IRON
STEEL
DAMASCUS
MITHRIL
EPIC
LEGEND
MYTHICAL
```

Urutan kekuatan:

```text
IRON
  ↓
STEEL
  ↓
DAMASCUS
  ↓
MITHRIL
  ↓
EPIC
  ↓
LEGEND
  ↓
MYTHICAL
```

---

# 2. EQUIPMENT ID SYSTEM

Format ID:

```text
EQP-[TYPE]-[TIER]-[NUMBER]
```

Contoh:

```text
EQP-WPN-IRON-001
EQP-ARM-STEEL-001
EQP-ACC-EPIC-001
```

Keterangan:

```text
EQP = Equipment

WPN = Weapon
ARM = Armor
ACC = Accessory
```

---

# 3. EQUIPMENT TIER

| Tier     | Code     | Rank |
| -------- | -------- | ---: |
| Iron     | IRON     |    1 |
| Steel    | STEEL    |    2 |
| Damascus | DAMASCUS |    3 |
| Mithril  | MITHRIL  |    4 |
| Epic     | EPIC     |    5 |
| Legend   | LEGEND   |    6 |
| Mythical | MYTHICAL |    7 |

---

# 4. STAT SYSTEM

Equipment menggunakan stat utama:

```text
ATK
MGATK
DEF
HP
MP
CRIT
SPEED
```

Keterangan:

```text
ATK   = Physical Attack
MGATK = Magic Attack
DEF   = Defense
HP    = Health Point
MP    = Mana Point
CRIT  = Critical Chance
SPEED = Action Speed
```

Weapon umumnya memberikan:

```text
ATK
MGATK
CRIT
SPEED
```

Senjata yang berfokus pada Mage atau Magic Build wajib menggunakan stat:

```text
MGATK
```

Senjata Mage dapat tetap memiliki `ATK` sebagai stat sekunder, tetapi sumber kekuatan utamanya harus berasal dari `MGATK`.

Armor umumnya memberikan:

```text
DEF
HP
```

Accessory dapat memberikan:

```text
HP
ATK
MGATK
DEF
CRIT
SPEED
MP
```

