# 8. EQUIPMENT DATABASE

Database utama:

```text
Equipment
│
├── Equipment_ID
├── Name
├── Type
├── Tier
├── ATK
├── MGATK
├── DEF
├── HP
├── MP
├── CRIT
├── SPEED
├── Effect
├── Special Effect
├── Source
├── Required Level
├── Owner Hero ID
└── Inventory Status
```

---

# 9. EQUIPMENT OWNERSHIP

Equipment yang diperoleh akan masuk ke:

```text
Inventory System
```

Default:

```text
Owner Hero ID = NULL
Status = STORED
```

Setelah Master memberikan equipment:

```text
Owner Hero ID = HERO-XXXX
Status = EQUIPPED
```

