   ↓
EQUIPMENT GENERATED
   ↓
CHECK EQUIPMENT ID
   ↓
DATABASE
   ↓
INVENTORY
   ↓
MASTER ASSIGNS EQUIPMENT
   ↓
HERO
   ↓
EQUIPMENT STATS UPDATE
```

---

# 11. EQUIPMENT DUPLICATE RULE

Equipment dapat memiliki ID database yang berbeda walaupun nama dan tier sama.

Contoh:

```text
EQP-WPN-IRON-001
EQP-WPN-IRON-001-COPY
```

Namun untuk **equipment instance**, ID harus unik.

Format:

```text
Equipment Template ID
+
Equipment Instance ID
```

Contoh:

```text
Template:
EQP-WPN-LEGEND-001

Instance:
EQI-00000001
```

Dengan demikian satu template dapat menghasilkan banyak equipment instance.

---

# 12. EQUIPMENT INSTANCE

Contoh:

```text
Equipment Template
        ↓
Legend Holy Sword
        ↓
EQP-WPN-LEGEND-001
        ↓
Generate Instance
        ↓
EQI-000001
```

Database:

```text
Equipment_ID     : EQI-000001
Template_ID      : EQP-WPN-LEGEND-001
Name             : Legend Holy Sword
Tier             : LEGEND
Owner_Hero_ID    : HERO-00025
Status            : EQUIPPED
```

